@startuml
title Online Quiz System — use cases (19 Nov 2026)
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Teacher
actor Administrator as Admin
rectangle "Online Quiz System" {
  usecase "Register / sign in" as Auth
  usecase "Browse active quizzes" as Browse
  usecase "Start and answer quiz" as Take
  usecase "Submit and view score" as Score
  usecase "Create and manage own quizzes" as Create
  usecase "Activate / deactivate quiz" as Publish
  usecase "Manage any quiz" as AdminQuiz
  usecase "View grade history" as History
  usecase "Manage users" as Users
}
Student --> Auth
Student --> Browse
Student --> Take
Student --> Score
Teacher --> Auth
Teacher --> Create
Teacher --> Publish
Admin --> Auth
Admin --> AdminQuiz
Admin --> Publish
AdminQuiz ..> Create : <<include>>
History ..> Score : not implemented
Users ..> Auth : not implemented
note bottom
Grade history and user management are in the submitted SRS scope but not
implemented. This is source-authored PlantUML, not a MUL export.
See GAP-04 and GAP-05 in the deviation log.
end note
@enduml
